      "key": "Rainy_Day_Abigail",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The countryside looks more interesting on a day like this, don't you think?",
      "translation": "V takový den vypadá krajina zajímavěji, nemyslíš?",
      "sourceSHA256": "1e8292ebf2b85e7d7d63f374300da5a1c5a3d7966f38654ed330f0cd618aa37a",
      "translationSHA256": "2e64e8365e8df9816fc252fa5356ce815db3a6d42f85412bb5bdab194ebb79aa",
