      "key": "Rainy_Day_Haley",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hmmph. If this weather keeps up I'll get too pale.$s",
      "translation": "Hmpf. Jestli tohle počasí vydrží, budu příliš bledá.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "448577f996e40454865e261c9524a858b43360e11ee863bc1d4695665b258a68",
      "translationSHA256": "3d80042707b0ad0681a034ab645069ab215c6d8cbd417f7c4d883f7377e6cc22",
