      "key": "Rainy_Day_Elliott",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The rain makes me think of my old life by the ocean.#$e#Change is part of life. That's okay.",
      "translation": "Déšť mi připomíná můj dřívější život u oceánu.#$e#Změna je součástí života. A to je v pořádku.",
      "sourceSHA256": "3e690f60a669a8da3da61e3083d4d11c88cf76f8e875977de7401e65c9b5ad6e",
      "translationSHA256": "5e03649970b44bcd3f57b64066ac8a6da128a1a62f1d317ca7655a7e3b386d6e",
      "reviewChecks": [
