      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogue",
      "key": "Rainy_Day_Emily",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I know you pride yourself on your work, but don't overdo it today. Okay, honey?$u",
      "translation": "Vím, že si na své práci zakládáš, ale dnes to nepřeháněj. Dobře, zlato?$u",
      "sourceSHA256": "9f77cecc772836d762c4d8dc58328cba3146d007082fa70a7f28bd95814d771d",
      "translationSHA256": "468669de2d546b76d5f94e3e6b556afc0cd2953a27d2de16c81af1da4fd2d098",
