      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogue",
      "key": "Rainy_Night_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Ah...The soothing sound of rain overhead... I'm going to sleep well tonight.$h",
      "translation": "Á... Ten uklidňující zvuk deště nad hlavou... Dnes v noci se mi bude dobře spát.$h",
      "sourceSHA256": "4bc72822d264ac28de034c8d39f9e547af72a2545dbf93e8626eb3455aa6ac2a",
      "translationSHA256": "11a04faa27cf3a476620b8eec9fe167a097ef755e1c9246eda3f1ad17a6308eb",
