      "key": "Rainy_Night_5",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I'm glad you're home... It's a good night to stay inside.",
      "translation": "Je dobře, že jsi doma... Dnešní noc je jako stvořená k pobytu uvnitř.",
      "sourceSHA256": "748bae2c1d39feefdd79a9601e550d06123dbd66d15d9e3f39709796cbb0a899",
      "translationSHA256": "c54d332d0d78db1f3b59fb742b8bc49f74e95b1463a0f69163ef0196fac64a5c",
