      "key": "Rainy_Night_Maru",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Were you able to accomplish much today, hun?#$e#I tried to fix up some things around the house... you know, just little stuff.",
      "translation": "Podařilo se ti toho dnes hodně, zlato?#$e#Snažila jsem se opravit pár věcí kolem domu... však víš, jen drobnosti.",
