      "key": "Rainy_Night_Abigail",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I'm ready to hop into bed whenever you are. The sound of rain will put us right to sleep.",
      "translation": "Jakmile budeš chtít, můžeme skočit do postele. Zvuk deště nás hned uspí.",
      "sourceSHA256": "931b72c3312533718932172cc49d2438a0dbe5e1bf3dad6ab7e88a76da386df2",
      "translationSHA256": "f7df51bb08a699ef002edf0d817fb8ae9c51b52b38053819eaefdf7506d9fa5d",
